<h1>NASA SPACE APPS CHALLENGE 2026</h1>
<h2 style='border:none; margin-top:-5px; color:#475569;'>240 SECONDS OF GLORY: OFFICIAL PITCH SCRIPT & SCREEN RECORDING GUIDE</h2>

<div class='callout'>
  <strong>Project:</strong> AstraVital AI — Intelligent Astronaut Health Monitoring & Digital Twin Platform<br>
  <strong>Team:</strong> Team Zero<br>
  <strong>Challenge Track:</strong> Create Health Monitoring Software for Astronauts on Space Missions<br>
  <strong>Total Video Duration:</strong> Exactly 240 Seconds (4 Minutes 00 Seconds)<br>
  <strong>Total Spoken Word Count:</strong> 472 Words (~118 Words/Minute — Competition Standard)<br>
  <strong>Core Scientific Repositories:</strong> NASA OSDR, NASA GeneLab, NASA NTRS, NASA-STD-3001
</div>

