<h2>4. AUDIO, MUSIC & PRODUCTION RECOMMENDATIONS</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Background Music:</strong> Ambient cinematic sci-fi soundtrack (e.g., Hans Zimmer / Interstellar style synth strings at 60–70 BPM). Keep music volume at 12–15% under narration so the presenter's voice is crisp and clear.</li>
  <li><strong>Voiceover Delivery:</strong> Confident, articulate, pacing at ~118 words per minute. Warm and scientific. Use natural pauses after key hooks.</li>
  <li><strong>Visual Transitions:</strong> 0.25-second clean cuts or subtle cross-dissolves. Avoid jarring spin or slide wipes.</li>
  <li><strong>Resolution:</strong> 1080p (1920x1080) at 60 FPS. Fullscreen browser view (F11) with browser bookmarks hidden.</li>
</ul>

